WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
All 32 pieces start face down; no colours yet.
Capture every piece, or block all moves, to win.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:10.499 line:0
On your turn, flip a piece or move a face-up one;
here North flips a covered piece.

00:00:10.499 --> 00:00:16.999 line:0
The first flipped colour decides sides:
North turns up a black general and plays black.

00:00:16.999 --> 00:00:21.999 line:0
The black general may attack an adjacent covered
piece without knowing who it is.

00:00:21.999 --> 00:00:26.998 line:0
It is North’s own black soldier: it only turns over,
the general stays put and East moves.

00:00:26.998 --> 00:00:32.998 line:0
East flips a red elephant the general can take:
select the general, then the elephant.

00:00:32.998 --> 00:00:36.998 line:0
After a capture you may keep capturing,
or end the turn to stop.

00:00:36.998 --> 00:00:48.998 line:0
Fast-forward. Rank: general, advisor, elephant,
rook, horse, cannon, soldier.

00:00:48.998 --> 00:00:55.998 line:0
After a capture the black advisor may capture again,
but only with the same piece.

00:00:55.998 --> 00:00:58.998 line:0
Two captures; no target is left, so East moves.

00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:07.998 line:0
Fast-forward: North’s black pieces dwindle as East’s
red advisor closes in on the last one.

00:01:07.998 --> 00:01:17.000 line:0
All of North’s black pieces are captured;
East wins with eight pieces left.
